@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n15:T7bf,\\u003ch1\\u003eMetaRoom Cube\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover the MetaRoom Cube by Brightluxx in Dubai. Innovative 3D LED display for immersive experiences. Contact us for LED solutions in UAE!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e6-sided LED cube for fully immersive metaverse environments.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eModular 6-sided LED room that creates a fully enclosed virtual environment. Each wall, floor, and ceiling panel is independently driven for seamless 360° immersion. Positional audio and haptic floor feedback complete the multi-sensory experience. Ideal for enterprise metaverse meetings, virtual tourism, and training simulations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the pixel pitch of the MetaRoom Cube and how does it impact image quality?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe MetaRoom Cube features a 2.5mm pixel pitch, delivering high-resolution visuals with excellent clarity and detail. This fine pixel pitch is ideal for close-range viewing, ensuring immersive and sharp imagery across all six surfaces.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow is the MetaRoom Cube installed and what are the space requirements?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eInstallation involves configuring the modular 6-sided LED panels to create a fully enclosed cube, including walls, floor, and ceiling. Space requirements depend on the configured cube size, with professional support recommended for precise setup and calibration.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the warranty coverage for the MetaRoom Cube?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe MetaRoom Cube comes with a standard manufacturer’s warranty covering all LED panels and integrated components for 2 years. Extended warranty options and maintenance plans are available upon request for enterprise customers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the MetaRoom Cube compare with traditional LED walls or VR headsets?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eUnlike traditional LED walls, the MetaRoom Cube provides a fully enclosed 360° immersive environment with positional audio and haptic feedback. Compared to VR headsets, it enables shared physical presence without wearables, making it ideal for collaborative enterprise metaverse and simulation applications.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\"