ds_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/metaroom-cube\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tcb2,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the MetaRoom Cube and how does it impact image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MetaRoom Cube features a 2.5mm pixel pitch, delivering high-resolution visuals with excellent clarity and detail. This fine pixel pitch is ideal for close-range viewing, ensuring immersive and sharp imagery across all six surfaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the MetaRoom Cube installed and what are the space requirements?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation involves configuring the modular 6-sided LED panels to create a fully enclosed cube, including walls, floor, and ceiling. Space requirements depend on the configured cube size, with professional support recommended for precise setup and calibration.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the warranty coverage for the MetaRoom Cube?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The MetaRoom Cube comes with a standard manufacturer\\u2019s warranty covering all LED panels and integrated components for 2 years. Extended warranty options and maintenance plans are available upon request for enterprise customers.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the MetaRoom Cube compare with traditional LED walls or VR headsets?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike traditional LED walls, the MetaRoom Cube provides a fully enclosed 360\\u00b0 immersive environment with positional audio and haptic feedback. Compared to VR headsets, it enables shared physical presence without wearables, making it ideal for collaborative enterprise metaverse and simulation applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the MetaRoom Cube support interactive tracking and sensory feedback?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it includes inside-out 6DoF tracking to monitor user movement in real-time, along with a haptic feedback floor and 32-channel positional audio to enhance multi-sensory immersion for training or virtual tourism.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the MetaRoom Cube suitable for outdoor or bright environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness level of 800 nits, the MetaRoom Cube is optimized for indoor use with controlled lighting. For bright or outdoor environments, additional considerations or custom solutions may be needed.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What applications is the MetaRoom Cube best suited for?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It\\u2019s ideal for enterprise metaverse engagements, immersive virtual tourism experiences, and realistic training simulations. Its fully immersive 6-sided design allows for outstanding environmental replication and user interaction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical pricing context for investing in a MetaRoom Cube?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing depends on configuration and customization. As a premium immersive LED solution, it represents a significant investment for enterprises but offers unmatched immersive quality and technological integration tailored to complex virtual environments.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$