org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T7bf,<h1>MetaRoom Cube</h1><p>Discover the MetaRoom Cube by Brightluxx in Dubai. Innovative 3D LED display for immersive experiences. Contact us for LED solutions in UAE!</p><p><strong>6-sided LED cube for fully immersive metaverse environments.</strong></p><p>Modular 6-sided LED room that creates a fully enclosed virtual environment. Each wall, floor, and ceiling panel is independently driven for seamless 360° immersion. Positional audio and haptic floor feedback complete the multi-sensory experience. Ideal for enterprise metaverse meetings, virtual tourism, and training simulations.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the MetaRoom Cube and how does it impact image quality?</h3><p>The MetaRoom Cube features a 2.5mm pixel pitch, delivering high-resolution visuals with excellent clarity and detail. This fine pixel pitch is ideal for close-range viewing, ensuring immersive and sharp imagery across all six surfaces.</p><h3>How is the MetaRoom Cube installed and what are the space requirements?</h3><p>Installation involves configuring the modular 6-sided LED panels to create a fully enclosed cube, including walls, floor, and ceiling. Space requirements depend on the configured cube size, with professional support recommended for precise setup and calibration.</p><h3>What is the warranty coverage for the MetaRoom Cube?</h3><p>The MetaRoom Cube comes with a standard manufacturer’s warranty covering all LED panels and integrated components for 2 years. Extended warranty options and maintenance plans are available upon request for enterprise customers.</p><h3>How does the MetaRoom Cube compare with traditional LED walls or VR headsets?</h3><p>Unlike traditional LED walls, the MetaRoom Cube provides a fully enclosed 360° immersive environment with positional audio and haptic feedback. Compared to VR headsets, it enables shared physical presence without wearables, making it ideal for collaborative enterprise metaverse and simulation applications.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"MetaRoom Cube - Innovative LED Display Solution Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover the MetaRoom Cube by Brightluxx in Dubai. Innovative 3D LED display for immersive experiences. Contact us for LED solutions in UAE!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/metaroom-cube\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The page you requested does not exist.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/products\",\"children\":\"Browse products\"}]}]]}],[]]}]]}]}]]}]\n17:null\n13:true\na:300\na:C\n12:0\nc:\"$undefined\"\ne:\"$undefined\"\n11:\"$undefined\"\n9:\"$undefined\"\n"}}